<script crossorigin="" src="https://cdn.aippy.ai/static/perf-monitor.js?v=202607071730" data-no-bundle=""></script><script crossorigin="" src="//sdk.rum.aliyuncs.com/v2/browser-sdk.js"></script><script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@growthbook/growthbook/dist/bundles/index.min.js"></script></head>

<body>
  <div id="root"><div class="relative w-full h-screen overflow-hidden bg-[#14100a]"><div class="absolute inset-0"><img alt="" class="px-img h-full w-full object-cover" draggable="false" src="https://cdn.aippy.ai/asset/b000c36b36d0408685b4e14d2fea14dc.jpg?x-oss-process=image/format,webp" style="opacity: 0.55; filter: saturate(0.85);"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/60 via-black/40 to-black/80"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 z-30 flex flex-col overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar pixel px-3 py-4"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[380px]"><div class="text-center"><div class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-amber-200/80">simulacao social</div><h1 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-none" style="color: rgb(232, 194, 106);">MINHA CIDADE</h1><p class="mt-1 text-[10px] text-amber-100/75">Cuidar da cidade e cuidar de todos</p></div><div class="mt-3 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-200/80">Escolha com quem jogar</div><div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-col gap-2"><button class="btn-wood flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-md border-2 p-2 text-left" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42); border-color: rgb(232, 194, 106); box-shadow: rgba(232, 194, 106, 0.333) 0px 0px 0px 2px;"><div class="shrink-0 rounded border-2 flex items-center justify-center" style="width: 58px; height: 58px; border-color: rgb(232, 194, 106); background: rgb(32, 22, 12);"><img alt="Bia" class="px-img h-[52px] w-[52px] object-contain" draggable="false" src="https://cdn.aippy.ai/asset/5319badbe21a421da5d179ca377bdef1.png?x-oss-process=image/format,webp"></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-50">Bia</span><span class="rounded px-1 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(224, 97, 79);">Crianca, 9 anos</span></div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] leading-snug text-amber-100/75">Corre mais rapido e enxerga o mundo na altura dos bancos e das lixeiras.</p></div></button><button class="btn-wood flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-md border-2 p-2 text-left" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22); border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55); box-shadow: none;"><div class="shrink-0 rounded border-2 flex items-center justify-center" style="width: 58px; height: 58px; border-color: rgb(28, 16, 8); background: rgb(32, 22, 12);"><img alt="Seu Antonio" class="px-img h-[52px] w-[52px] object-contain" draggable="false" src="https://cdn.aippy.ai/asset/2c6e120a00994654803f9dfe48dcb4dc.png?x-oss-process=image/format,webp"></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-50">Seu Antonio</span><span class="rounded px-1 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(216, 163, 91);">Idoso, 78 anos</span></div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] leading-snug text-amber-100/75">Anda devagar e sente cada degrau, cada banco que falta e cada calcada irregular.</p></div></button><button class="btn-wood flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-md border-2 p-2 text-left" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22); border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55); box-shadow: none;"><div class="shrink-0 rounded border-2 flex items-center justify-center" style="width: 58px; height: 58px; border-color: rgb(28, 16, 8); background: rgb(32, 22, 12);"><img alt="Carla" class="px-img h-[52px] w-[52px] object-contain" draggable="false" src="https://cdn.aippy.ai/asset/5854d949c5ae479eb95a4b247d575251.png?x-oss-process=image/format,webp"></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-50">Carla</span><span class="rounded px-1 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(63, 143, 208);">Cadeirante, 34 anos</span></div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] leading-snug text-amber-100/75">Precisa de rampas e piso liso. Calcadas quebradas deixam seus passos muito lentos.</p></div></button></div><button class="btn-wood mt-3 w-full rounded-md border-2 px-3 py-3 text-[12px] font-bold" style="background: rgb(232, 194, 106); color: rgb(46, 26, 12); border-color: rgb(255, 246, 213); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45) 0px 5px 0px;">COMECAR A GOVERNAR</button><div class="mt-2 flex gap-2"><button class="btn-wood flex-1 rounded-md border-2 border-black/60 px-2 py-2 text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-50" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);">PAINEL IQV</button><button class="btn-wood flex-1 rounded-md border-2 border-black/60 px-2 py-2 text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-50" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);">DOCUMENTO (GDD)</button></div><p class="mt-3 text-center text-[9px] leading-snug text-amber-100/55">Arraste o dedo na tela para caminhar. Chegue perto de um ponto e use a Vassoura ou o Kit de Projetos.</p></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 z-40 flex flex-col p-2.5 bg-black/70 fade-in pixel"><div class="flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar rounded-lg border-2 p-3" style="background: linear-gradient(rgb(122, 79, 42) 0%, rgb(46, 26, 12) 100%); border-color: rgb(28, 16, 8); box-shadow: rgba(255, 220, 160, 0.22) 0px 0px 0px 2px inset;"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div><div class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-200/80">Painel da cidade</div><h2 class="text-[15px] font-bold text-amber-50">Qualidade de Vida</h2></div><button class="btn-wood rounded border-2 border-black/60 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-50" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);">FECHAR</button></div><div class="mt-2.5 rounded border-2 border-black/50 bg-black/35 p-2.5"><div class="flex items-end justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] text-amber-100/80">IQV coletivo</span><span class="text-2xl font-bold leading-none" style="color: rgb(232, 194, 106);">23</span></div><div class="mt-1.5 h-3 w-full overflow-hidden border border-black/60 bg-black/60"><div class="h-full transition-all duration-700" style="width: 23%; background: rgb(232, 194, 106); box-shadow: rgba(255, 220, 140, 0.75) 0px 0px 10px;"></div></div><div class="mt-1 flex justify-between text-[9px] text-amber-100/60"><span>Obras concluidas: 0/9</span><span>Verba restante: 110</span></div></div><div class="mt-2.5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(216, 163, 91);">I</span><span class="w-[74px] shrink-0 text-[9px] text-amber-50/90">Idosos</span><div class="h-2 flex-1 overflow-hidden border border-black/50 bg-black/55"><div class="h-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 24%; background: rgb(216, 163, 91);"></div></div><span class="w-6 text-right text-[9px] font-bold text-amber-100">24</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(224, 97, 79);">C</span><span class="w-[74px] shrink-0 text-[9px] text-amber-50/90">Criancas</span><div class="h-2 flex-1 overflow-hidden border border-black/50 bg-black/55"><div class="h-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 30%; background: rgb(224, 97, 79);"></div></div><span class="w-6 text-right text-[9px] font-bold text-amber-100">30</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(63, 143, 208);">A</span><span class="w-[74px] shrink-0 text-[9px] text-amber-50/90">PcD</span><div class="h-2 flex-1 overflow-hidden border border-black/50 bg-black/55"><div class="h-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 14%; background: rgb(63, 143, 208);"></div></div><span class="w-6 text-right text-[9px] font-bold text-amber-100">14</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(109, 155, 87);">M</span><span class="w-[74px] shrink-0 text-[9px] text-amber-50/90">Meio ambiente</span><div class="h-2 flex-1 overflow-hidden border border-black/50 bg-black/55"><div class="h-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 20%; background: rgb(109, 155, 87);"></div></div><span class="w-6 text-right text-[9px] font-bold text-amber-100">20</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(201, 106, 106);">S</span><span class="w-[74px] shrink-0 text-[9px] text-amber-50/90">Saude</span><div class="h-2 flex-1 overflow-hidden border border-black/50 bg-black/55"><div class="h-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 22%; background: rgb(201, 106, 106);"></div></div><span class="w-6 text-right text-[9px] font-bold text-amber-100">22</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(143, 122, 208);">E</span><span class="w-[74px] shrink-0 text-[9px] text-amber-50/90">Educacao</span><div class="h-2 flex-1 overflow-hidden border border-black/50 bg-black/55"><div class="h-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 26%; background: rgb(143, 122, 208);"></div></div><span class="w-6 text-right text-[9px] font-bold text-amber-100">26</span></div></div><div class="mt-3 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-200/80">Missoes em andamento</div><div class="mt-1 flex flex-col gap-1.5"><div class="rounded border-2 border-black/50 bg-black/30 p-2" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-50">Desafio do Lixo</span><span class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(232, 194, 106);">0/2</span></div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] leading-snug text-amber-100/70">Mapear os focos, organizar o mutirao e instalar lixeiras acessiveis.</p></div><div class="rounded border-2 border-black/50 bg-black/30 p-2" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-50">Desafio da Acessibilidade</span><span class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(232, 194, 106);">0/4</span></div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] leading-snug text-amber-100/70">Nivelar calcadas, instalar rampas e piso tatil nos pontos criticos.</p></div><div class="rounded border-2 border-black/50 bg-black/30 p-2" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-50">Saude Perto de Todos</span><span class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(232, 194, 106);">0/1</span></div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] leading-snug text-amber-100/70">Reequipar o posto e garantir atendimento perto de quem mais precisa.</p></div><div class="rounded border-2 border-black/50 bg-black/30 p-2" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-50">Escola Viva</span><span class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(232, 194, 106);">0/1</span></div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] leading-snug text-amber-100/70">Levar materiais, oficinas e atividades extracurriculares para a escola.</p></div><div class="rounded border-2 border-black/50 bg-black/30 p-2" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-50">Infancia Segura</span><span class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-black" style="background: rgb(232, 194, 106);">0/1</span></div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] leading-snug text-amber-100/70">Construir um parquinho seguro para as criancas da cidade.</p></div></div><div class="mt-3 rounded border-2 border-black/50 bg-black/30 p-2"><div class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-200/80">Quem ja conversou com voce</div><p class="mt-0.5 text-[9px] text-amber-100/70">0 de 5 moradores. Ouvir e o primeiro passo de qualquer obra.</p></div></div></div></div></div>


