k Simulator",prompt3:"Sneaker drop frustration simulator. Flow 1. Show cool sneaker with 30 second countdown 2. Timer ends reveals BUY NOW button 3. Click triggers random frustration 4. 4 Random Outcomes 5. Lag then button becomes unresponsive 6. Sold out message with waitlist 7. Queue with thousands ahead of you 8. Payment fails at checkout 9. Simulates real sneaker drop anxiety and disappointment",title4:"iPhone Unlock Prank",prompt4:"Create an iPhone lock screen that reveals a giant skull emoji when swiped up. Requirements: 1. iOS lock screen with time and date 2. Blur background effect 3. Slide to unlock text 4. Swipe gesture animation 5. Large emoji reveal 6. Mobile responsive",title5:"iPhone Meme Unlock",prompt5:"iPhone lock screen with swipe-up to reveal giant emoji. Features: 1. iPhone lock screen UI with time/date display 2. Clean iOS aesthetic with blur effects 'Slide to unlock' indicator at bottom 3. Swipe gesture reveals oversized emoji üíÄ ,mininal background 4. Smooth unlock animation Mobile compatible"}},community={title:"Catch the Vibe.",subtitle:"Dive into what the Aippy community is creating.",show_more:"Show More",view_details:"View Details",back:"Back",explore_more:"Explore More in Community",view_all:"View All"},FAQ={title:"Frequently Asked Questions",subtitle1:"Got questions? We've got answers.",subtitle2:"If you can't find what you're looking for, feel free to contact our support team.",list:{question1:"Who is Aippy?",answer1_1:"Aippy is your AI-powered teammate for full-stack creation.",answer1_2:"Just describe what you want to build ‚Äî Aippy turns your ideas into working apps, websites, and tools. No code required.",answer1_3:"Aippy handles the tech ‚Äî you stay in the flow.",question2:"What can Aippy build?",answer2_1:"Pretty much anything ‚Äî Websites. Tools. Games. Agents. MVPs.",answer2_2:"From practical tools to playful side projects. You bring the idea. Aippy builds the vibe. No idea is too small.",answer2_3:"üé® Check out the",answer2_link:"Community",answer2_4:"to see what others are creating.",question3:"How do I write a good prompt?",answer3_1:"Be clear, not perfect.",answer3_2:"Aippy's here to help ‚Äî but it needs your help too.",answer3_3:"The best results come from clear, thoughtful prompts.",answer3_4:"Like any good teammate, Aippy works best when it fully understands your goals.",answer3_link:"See prompt tips",question4:"How do I customize the content Aippy creates?",answer4_1:"You can customize your project in two easy ways ‚Äî no coding needed:",answer4_2:"Chat with Aippy.",answer4_3:"Just describe what you want to change, and Aippy will update your project.",answer4_4:"Edit directly in the preview.",answer4_5:"Click to edit text, swap images or icons, or upload your own ‚Äî all in real time.",question5:"Can Aippy build both frontend and backend?",answer5_1:"Yes! Aippy generates",answer5_2:"full-stack",answer5_3:"applications, including frontend UIs, backend APIs, and optional data connections.",answer5_4:"You can create dynamic, interactive apps without managing servers or writing code.",question6:"Can I clone or remix existing projects?",answer6_1:"Yes, Aippy lets you explore and remix community-created projects ‚Äî",answer6_2:"only if the creator allows it.",answer6_3:"You can start from scratch or build upon a vibe you love.",answer6_4:" We respect creators: remixed projects always credit the original, and users are encouraged to build ethically and creatively."}},footer={company:"Company",support:"Support",legal:"Legal",feedback:"Feedback",welcome:"Welcome",faq:"FAQ",changelog:"Changelog",roadmap:"Roadmap",privacy_policy:"Privacy Policy",terms_of_service:"Terms of Service",about_us:"About Us"},errors={0:"",10001:"This project may have been deleted or never existed.",10002:"Failed to send request. Please try again.",10003:"Please enter a valid email address.",10004:"Please sign in to continue.",10005:"This item may have been deleted or never existed.",10006:"This email is alrea